{"lexicon" 1,
 "id" "com.etzhayyim.kurashimori.escalationReferral",
 "description"
 "A referral routing a stalled self-help matter to a lawful external forum (ADR-2605312500 §3, kurashimori_escalation): 消費生活センター / 消費者ホットライン 188 / ADR (指定紛争解決機関) / chigiri + licensed counsel. CONSTITUTIONAL: kurashimori ROUTES, it does not represent (G5/N1); legal characterization + representation happen at the destination; member PII stays encrypted (G6). The referral is a pointer + rationale, never inline contract/complaint content.",
